# Observability

Important flows should be explainable after the fact. Where the domain has them, correlate request, user, organization, agent run, model call, retrieval, tool call, job, and outbound request.

Prefer structured logs, a few latency and error metrics, and traces on cross-service or multi-step agent work. Record retries, token usage, and cost when AI calls are material.

Never log secrets. Treat prompt and document content as sensitive unless a logging policy allows it.

A new background job or external call ships with a way to see failure, not only success.
